<p>Our zero-accident achievement encompasses all our active project sites, including complex industrial installations, high-rise construction projects, and infrastructure development works. Each of these sites presents unique safety challenges, making this accomplishment even more significant. From working at heights to handling heavy machinery, from electrical installations to confined space operations, our teams have consistently demonstrated exemplary safety practices.</p>

