<p>This achievement is the result of a comprehensive and robust safety management system that we have developed and refined over years of experience. Our approach to safety is multi-layered, combining proactive hazard identification, rigorous training programs, state-of-the-art safety equipment, and a strong safety culture that permeates every level of our organization.</p>

