<p>Our quality assurance team worked in close coordination with NTPC\'s quality inspectors, maintaining transparency and ensuring that all work met the client\'s exacting standards. We conducted multiple levels of inspection – self-inspection by our installation teams, verification by our quality team, and final acceptance by NTPC\'s inspectors.</p>

